{"id": "EUVD-2026-80576", "enisaUuid": "d5b8c94e-7765-3b10-8779-82ac41b3c849", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\naccel/ethosu: fix job completion fence cleanup\n\nethosu_ioctl_submit_job() allocates done_fence before validating buffer\nhandles. Errors after allocation call ethosu_job_err_cleanup(), which frees\nthe job but leaks the uninitialized fence.\n\nA scheduler dependency error also lets ethosu_job_run() return before\ndma_fence_init(). Normal cleanup then passes a zeroed refcount to\ndma_fence_put().\n\nRelease done_fence in the common cleanup path and use\ndma_fence_was_initialized() to distinguish initialized fences from raw\nallocations.\n\n[robh: also fix goto]", "datePublished": "2026-09-16T10:32:54", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T08:55:51", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b3e0f79af1f27339d8d2527c02cc3e8397c2f69f", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2d2a3adc91950f9a18829dadc7317fb5180a15c5"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-89976", "GHSA-xw3m-mp44-62gr"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "67001089-ba60-38a4-ac89-f715438720a0", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.5"}, {"id": "994bd132-c244-3285-beb5-036be525ea6c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "5a5e9c0228e613f0ef2a58b9782d7c0ea8f1e58b <2d2a3adc91950f9a18829dadc7317fb5180a15c5"}, {"id": "d34843a9-5dff-3b1d-aa62-0eb151319513", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.19"}, {"id": "f102e944-0e78-3ea9-b9d9-f5bc91c2b4f3", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "5a5e9c0228e613f0ef2a58b9782d7c0ea8f1e58b <b3e0f79af1f27339d8d2527c02cc3e8397c2f69f"}, {"id": "f76b19fa-954d-3c08-9948-b3be348d8feb", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "fbc30218-f5eb-3260-abd9-4d95b0da9f31", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "ea72ff9e-ceae-36ea-a86c-d1688070ff95", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}